{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../examples/UserLinking/", "title": "Start Linking The User"}, "next": {"link": "../reference/auth_server/server_client/", "title": "Server Client"}, "title": "Contribution", "meta": {"myst_slugs": {"contribution": [2, "contribution", "Contribution"], "environment-setup": [6, "environment-setup", "Environment setup"], "local-development": [12, "local-development", "Local development"], "testing": [18, "testing", "Testing"], "adding-tests": [20, "adding-tests", "Adding tests"], "running-tests": [24, "running-tests", "Running tests"]}, "wordcount": {"words": 66, "minutes": 0}}, "body": "<section id=\"contribution\">\n<h1>Contribution<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#contribution\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Please read <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/auth0/open-source-template/blob/master/GENERAL-CONTRIBUTING.md\">Auth0\u2019s contribution guidelines</a>.</p>\n<section id=\"environment-setup\">\n<h2>Environment setup<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#environment-setup\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Make sure you have node and npm installed</p></li>\n<li><p>Run <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">poetry</span> <span class=\"pre\">install</span></code> to install dependencies</p></li>\n<li><p>Follow the local development steps below to get started</p></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section id=\"local-development\">\n<h2>Local development<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#local-development\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">poetry</span> <span class=\"pre\">install</span></code>: install dependencies</p></li>\n<li><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">poetry</span> <span class=\"pre\">run</span> <span class=\"pre\">pytest</span></code>: run unit tests</p></li>\n<li><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">poetry</span> <span class=\"pre\">build</span></code>: compile the package</p></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section id=\"testing\">\n<h2>Testing<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#testing\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<section id=\"adding-tests\">\n<h3>Adding tests<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#adding-tests\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h3>\n<p>Every change should be accompanied by a test.</p>\n</section>\n<section id=\"running-tests\">\n<h3>Running tests<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#running-tests\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h3>\n<p>Run unit tests before opening a PR:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-bash notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span>poetry<span class=\"w\"> </span>run<span class=\"w\"> </span>pytest\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<p>Also include any information about essential manual tests.</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth_server/server_client/index", "Server Client", "N", "next"], ["examples/UserLinking", "Start Linking The User", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "CONTRIBUTING.md.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Contribution</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#environment-setup\">Environment setup</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#local-development\">Local development</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#testing\">Testing</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#adding-tests\">Adding tests</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#running-tests\">Running tests</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".md", "current_page_name": "CONTRIBUTING", "sidebars": ["about.html", "navigation.html", "relations.html", "searchbox.html", "donate.html"], "alabaster_version": "0.7.16", "alabaster_version_info": [0, 7, 16]}